	(text "Calculation for SHUNT resistance and\nADC scale: 2^12 = 4096  @ 5V\n1 bit = 5V/2^12 = 0.0012V\ncase fan:\n~2W @ 12V -> ~200mA\nset 500mA = 4/5 full scale = 4V\n~160mOhm ->  32mV @200mA\n\n4V/80mV = ~50 V/V\n"
